                        "review": "Fluid, original and deep gameplay mechanics.\n\nThe design make it feels like it's a casual game, but it really isn't.\\\nThe leveling is way too hard for casual players.\nEven if you understand and use the various combo, the ennemy is pushing way too fast and hard.\nI get stuck on the 4th level while my character is fully upgraded and I'm fully focused on the game.\n\nSo very good for tryharder, not for people who'd like to progress peacefully without re-doing each level 10times.\n\n",
